  "Nothing to play": "Chan eil dad ri chluich",
  "Off": "Dheth",
  "Off, your own background is left out of it: the theme keeps its own colours while the picture is up, and only moves when a title's artwork covers it.": "Nuair a tha e dheth, fàgar do chùlaibh fhèin a-mach às: cumaidh an t-ùrlar na dathan aige fhèin fhad 's a tha an dealbh ri fhaicinn, agus cha ghluais e ach nuair a chòmhdaicheas ealain tiotail e.",
  "On the air": "'Ga chraoladh",
  "On, the background follows whichever card you're pointing at or have selected. Off, it only changes when you actually open something — steadier on a long list, where sweeping across a row otherwise repaints the whole window card by card.": "Nuair a tha e air, leanaidh an cùlaibh a' chairt air a bheil thu a' comharrachadh no a thagh thu. Nuair a tha e dheth, chan atharraich e ach nuair a dh'fhosglas tu rudeigin dha-rìribh — nas sìtheile air liosta fhada, far am biodh sguabadh thairis air sreath ag ath-pheantadh na h-uinneige gu lèir cairt air chairt.",
  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "Nuair a tha e air, 's e an dealbh agad air a bheil an aplacaid na laighe, agus còmhdaichidh an ealain e fhad 's a tha thu air film no sreath. Nuair a tha e dheth, fanaidh an dealbh far a bheil e agus cha chòmhdaich dad e a-riamh.",
  "One colour, and Material's own generator works out the rest of the palette from it.": "Aon dath, agus obraichidh gineadair Material fhèin a-mach an còrr dhen phaileit uaithe.",
