  "That backup is empty.": "Tha an lethbhreac-glèidhidh sin falamh.",
  "That backup is in format {version}, which this build doesn't know how to read.": "Tha an lethbhreac-glèidhidh sin ann am fòrmat {version}, nach eil fios aig an togail seo mar a leughas i.",
