  "{count} earlier episodes in this season are still unwatched.": "Tha {count} eapasod nas tràithe san t-seusan seo gun choimhead fhathast.",
  "{count} earlier seasons are still unwatched.": "Tha {count} seusan nas tràithe gun choimhead fhathast.",
